% Obligation: x * 8 == x << 3, for every 64-bit word x.
% The strength reduction a compiler performs silently. Wrong by one bit and every
% multiply-by-power-of-two in the tree is wrong, and nothing else would notice --
% the two sides are built by completely different hardware here (bb_mul64's
% partial-product rows and ripple-carry adds versus the shifter's pure literal
% renaming), so agreement is not an artefact of a shared path.
obligation mul8_is_shl3
1 var x
2 const 8
3 mul 1 2
4 shl 1 3
5 eq 3 4
prove 5
